msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "NEC - PC Engine / SuperGrafx / CD (Beetle PCE)"
msgstr "NEC - PC Engine / SuperGrafx / CD (Beetle PCE)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid ""
"Beetle PC Engine is a fork of Mednafen's PC Engine driver.[CR][CR]This PC "
"Engine module is more accurate than the Beetle PC Engine Fast module, at the "
"expense of speed."
msgstr "Beetle PC Engine är en avknoppning av Mednafens PC Engine-drivrutin[CR][CR]Denna PC Engine-modul är mer exakt än Beetle PC Engine Fast-modulen, på bekostnad av hastigheten."

